{"candidateAnswer":"Yes, Jon and Gina do.","evidence":"[D1:4 | 4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023] Jon: Sorry to hear that! I'm starting a dance studio 'cause I'm passionate about dancing and it'd be great to share it with others.\n[D6:8 | 2:35 pm on 16 March, 2023] Gina: Thanks! I'm passionate about fashion trends and finding unique pieces. Plus, I wanted to blend my love for dance and fashion, so it was a perfect match.","itemId":"urn:uuid:d2f98573-c313-51f4-9fe8-249d5650df8e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f7243e9ab58abdfb757e7d7eb5d4ad911a333bda57d5a84937cae59f88dc6502","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Do Jon and Gina start businesses out of what they love?","referenceAnswer":"Yes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f7243e9ab58abdfb757e7d7eb5d4ad911a333bda57d5a84937cae59f88dc6502"}}]}